"<xref linkend=\"cmake\"/> (can be used instead of the "
"<command>configure</command> script), <xref linkend=\"libgcrypt\"/> (can be "
"used instead of OpenSSL), <xref linkend=\"openssh\"/> (for some tests), and "
"<ulink url='https://www.docker.com'>Docker</ulink> (for some tests)"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"cmake\"/> (pode ser usado em vez do conjunto de comandos "
"sequenciais <command>configure</command>), <xref linkend=\"libgcrypt\"/> "
"(pode ser usado em vez do OpenSSL), <xref linkend=\"openssh\"/> (para alguns"
" testes) e <ulink url='https://www.docker.com'>Docker</ulink> (para alguns "
"testes)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libssh2.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of libssh2"
msgstr "Instalação do libssh2"

#.  the Terrapin attack
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libssh2.xml:98
#, xml-text
msgid "First, fix a critical security vulnerability in libssh2:"
msgstr "Primeiro, corrija uma vulnerabilidade crítica de segurança na libssh2:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libssh2.xml:101
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i "
"../libssh2-&libssh2-version;-security_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i "
"../libssh2-&libssh2-version;-security_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libssh2.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you want to test the package, exclude the tests requiring a static "
"library:"
msgstr ""
"Se você quiser testar o pacote, exclua os testes que exigem uma biblioteca "
"estática:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libssh2.xml:108
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -E '/^DOCKER_TEST/,/^SSHD_TEST/s/test_(auth_keyboard_info.* |hostkey |simple)/$(NOTHING)/' \\\n"
"    -i tests/Makefile.inc &amp;&amp;\n"
"autoreconf -fi</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -E '/^DOCKER_TEST/,/^SSHD_TEST/s/test_(auth_keyboard_info.* |hostkey |simple)/$(NOTHING)/' \\\n"
"    -i tests/Makefile.inc &amp;&amp;\n"
"autoreconf -fi</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libssh2.xml:113
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libssh2</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>libssh2</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libssh2.xml:117
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"            --disable-docker-tests \\\n"
"            --disable-static       &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"            --disable-docker-tests \\\n"
"            --disable-static       &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libssh2.xml:123
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libssh2.xml:127
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libssh2.xml:130
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libssh2.xml:134
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libssh2.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-docker-tests</parameter>: Disable the tests requiring "
"Docker, which is beyond the scope of BLFS.  Remove this switch if you've "
"installed Docker and you wish to run the test suite."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-docker-tests</parameter>: Desabilita os testes que "
"exigem Docker, o qual está além do escopo do BLFS. Remova essa chave se você"
" tiver instalado o Docker e desejar executar a suíte de teste."

